  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I<br />\t\t\tPollutant</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II<br />\t\t\tDisease /sickness</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Sulphate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>ppm</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Methemoglobinemia</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Nitrate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>ppm</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>Brown mottling of teeth</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Lead&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>ppb</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Laxative effect</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Fluoride&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ppm</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Kidney damage</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
